  "note": "For even q, r' = q/2 occurs in both sums though r = ±q/2 is one residue; harmless, since the '−qδ₂' term alone bounds it. Lean's families are exactly those of (4.4), but each is then bounded by monotonicity rather than the book's count of A-terms."
